  "body": "## Changes\r\nThis pull request introduces a new GitHub Actions workflow to automate code reviews using Claude. The workflow is triggered on pull request events and integrates the Claude Code Review action for automated feedback.\r\n\r\n**New workflow for automated code review:**\r\n\r\n* Added `.github/workflows/claude-code-review.yml` to run the Claude Code Review GitHub Action on pull requests, configuring authentication, permissions, and integration with the Claude code review plugin.",
